l over my horn like I used to, you understand what I mean. When I came to New York I was the fastest cat, fast as grease lightening. That I don't do because, I'll tell you why Chick Webb was the first on... about that. My brother was trying to get me a job when I first-come here in 1929 and I was down jamming at the Rhythm Club  ...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q10013$58C958C3-F317-42CC-87F0-061BD328FC3B", "rank": "normal"}], "P20": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P20", "hash": "4bbb4315557bfc1d7ccb382ef00f6bf4be3cf0d0", "datavalue": {"value": "https://semlab.s3.amazonaws.com/texts/69cd57581c725e679d1620ca27d6ce80/145.txt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q10013$08F5712A-E4F8-4DC4-BCEF-0A8866375F7A", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "6651cee0aa7c01d0e67979af9b05b538f7134e38", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 177, "id": "Q177"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q10013$A2838E90-7453-45AF-A394-0493787FD62F", "rank": "normal"}], "P22": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P22", "hash": "d191683b99c39397a6285f3d2a961f8941cf960b", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 249, "id": "Q249"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q10013$CD419A22-A5C1-4448-B51D-1C4A450556F3", "rank": "normal"}], "P23": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P23", "hash": "1565396ab66512cf9ae8a8926eac4f64b2e49ef4", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 249, "id": "Q249"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q10013$33F85ECD-3DFF-4BCC-A588-397B60C15C7E", "rank": "normal"}]}}